# Cursor Rules — Luna AI Chat Template

This file provides guidance for AI assistants working with this codebase. It mirrors CLAUDE.md at the repo root — keep both in sync.

**Last verified:** 2026-09-23 (Expo SDK 57)

## Project Overview

Luna is an AI chat app template (ChatGPT-style) built with Expo, NativeWind (TailwindCSS) and TypeScript. The main flow is a drawer-based chat: four chat layouts (`(drawer)/index`, `suggestions`, `lottie`, `mic-animation`) share the same `ChatInput` + `Conversation` components and stream replies from a real LLM provider (OpenAI, Gemini or Claude) chosen via `.env`; without a key the app returns a canned "add your API key" reply. Voice input records with `expo-audio` and transcribes through OpenAI Whisper (mock transcription when no key). Pushed screens cover onboarding/auth (`welcome`, `login`, `signup`, `forgot-password`), account (`profile`, `edit-profile`, `ai-voice`, `help`, `subscription`) and an "Explore" model directory (`search-form`, `provider`).

NOT included: no backend or database, no auth provider (login/signup only `setTimeout` then navigate), no payments (the subscription screen is UI only), no message persistence (chat state lives in `useState`), no i18n, no maps, no push notifications. Do not install any of these unless asked.

## Tech Stack

- **Framework**: React Native 0.86.3 + Expo SDK 57 (`expo ~57.0.22`, React 19.2.3)
- **Styling**: NativeWind v4 (`nativewind ^4.2.6`, TailwindCSS 3) with CSS-variable theme
- **Navigation**: Expo Router ~57.0.21 — root `Stack` → `(drawer)` group (`expo-router/drawer`, custom drawer content) + pushed `app/screens/*`
- **AI**: plain `fetch` to OpenAI (`gpt-4o-mini`), Google Gemini (`gemini-2.0-flash`) and Anthropic (`claude-3-haiku-20240307`) in `services/providers/*`; Whisper (`whisper-1`) for speech-to-text
- **Audio**: `expo-audio` (`useAudioRecorder`), `expo-image-picker` for attachments
- **Animations**: Reanimated 4.5.1 + `react-native-worklets`, Lottie (`lottie-react-native ~7.3.8`), RN `Animated` in older components
- **Keyboard**: `react-native-keyboard-controller` 1.21.9 (`KeyboardProvider`, `useReanimatedKeyboardAnimation`)
- **Icons**: Lucide (`lucide-react-native`) via the `Icon` component
- **Markdown**: `react-native-markdown-display` (assistant messages)
- **Sheets**: `react-native-actions-sheet` via `ActionSheetThemed`
- **Fonts**: Outfit (`@expo-google-fonts/outfit`) → `font-outfit`, `font-outfit-bold`
- **Language**: TypeScript (strict), path alias `@/*` → repo root

