| Vertical scroll | `ThemedScroller` (default from `@/components/ThemeScroller`) — has `bg-background px-global` built in, `headerSpace` prop |
| Lists (FlatList) | `ThemedFlatList` (default from `@/components/ThemeFlatList`) |
| Sticky bottom bar | `ThemeFooter` (default from `@/components/ThemeFooter`, see `provider.tsx`) |
| Horizontal scroll | `{ CardScroller }` — NEVER a custom horizontal ScrollView (`title`, `allUrl`, `space`, `enableSnapping`) |
| Section headers | `Section` (`@/components/layout/Section`) — `title`, `subtitle`, `titleSize`, `padding`, `link/linkText` |
| Buttons/CTAs | `{ Button }` — `variant: primary \| secondary \| outline \| ghost`, `size`, `rounded`, `href`, `iconStart/iconEnd`, `loading` |
| Icons | `Icon` (default) — Lucide `name`, `size`, `variant: plain \| bordered \| contained`, `iconSize`, `href`, `onPress` |
| Tags/filters | `{ Chip }` — `label`, `isSelected`, `selectable`, `icon`, `image`, `href` |
| Settings rows | `ListLink` (default) — `icon`, `title`, `description`, `href`, `hasBorder`, `showChevron` |
| Rich list rows | `ListItem`, `List` (`@/components/layout/*`) |
| Collapsible FAQ | `Expandable` (default) — `title`, `description`, `icon`, `defaultExpanded` |
