## Theme Colors (Tailwind classes)

```
background  - Screen background        (#f5f5f5 / #171717)
secondary   - Cards, bubbles, inputs   (#ffffff / #323232)
primary     - Text + solid buttons     (#000000 / #ffffff)
invert      - Text on primary surfaces (#ffffff / #000000)
text        - Same as primary          (#000000 / #ffffff)
subtext     - Muted text               (#64748B / #A1A1A1)
highlight   - Brand sky blue           (#0EA5E9 both)
border      - Borders/dividers         (rgba(0,0,0,0.1) / rgba(255,255,255,0.15))
darker      - Deeper background        (#F4F4F5 / #000000)
```

JS access: `const colors = useThemeColors()` from `@/app/contexts/ThemeColors` — `colors.bg`, `colors.text`, `colors.invert`, `colors.secondary`, `colors.highlight`, `colors.border`, `colors.placeholder`, `colors.sheet`, `colors.chatBg`, `colors.gradient` (the bottom fade used by chat screens), `colors.isDark`. `useTheme()` from `ThemeContext` gives `isDark` and `toggleTheme`.

## Spacing Standards

```
px-global / p-global / mb-global   # 16px (tailwind.config.js spacing.global) — built into ThemedScroller, Header, ThemeFooter
-mx-global px-global               # full-bleed horizontal scroller (CardScroller does this)
gap-2 / gap-x-2                    # 8px between inline items
p-4, p-3                           # card / suggestion padding
rounded-3xl / rounded-full         # cards & pills; ChatInput uses rounded-[25px]
mt-14                              # gap between stacked Sections (help.tsx)
```

